            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/variational+calculus"} variation
            of this contribution in addition to that of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/kinetic+action"} kinetic action
            of the electron gives the
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lorentz+force"} Lorentz force
